---@field account_id string Represents a Cloudflare resource identifier tag.
---@field action cloudflare.billing.CreateSpendPolicyRequestAction|string The action taken when the threshold is reached. `notification` sends an email to `notification_email`. `usage_block` blocks further usage of the product until the end of the billing period. Raising the threshold above the current balance, disabling the policy, or deleting it lifts the block early.
---@field enabled boolean Whether the policy is evaluated.
---@field name string Display name of the policy. After surrounding whitespace is trimmed, it must be 1 to 200 bytes long. The value is stored as sent, untrimmed.
---@field product_id cloudflare.billing.CreateSpendPolicyRequestProductId|string The product the policy applies to: `workers` or `durable_objects`. Each product's balance and policies are separate. Both products support `notification` and `usage_block` policies on create and update.
---@field threshold_cents number The spend threshold for the current billing period, in US cents. Must be greater than zero.
---@field notification_email? string Email address that receives notifications. Required when `action` is `notification`. When set, it must be a bare address (`user@example.com`); display-name forms such as `Name <user@example.com>` are rejected.

