---@class cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV1ResultItem
---@field BilledCost number The amount invoiced for this charge. PayGo is billed directly by Cloudflare, so this equals ContractedCost.
---@field BillingAccountId string The identifier of the account the charge is billed to (account tag).
---@field BillingAccountName string The display name of the billing account. Null when the name could not be resolved.
---@field BillingCurrency string Specifies the billing currency code (ISO 4217).
---@field BillingPeriodStart string Indicates the start of the billing period. There is no `BillingPeriodEnd` counterpart; see the known gaps described on this schema.
---@field ChargeCategory cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV1ResultItemChargeCategory Describes the nature of the charge. Always "Usage" for this endpoint, which only returns metered usage.
---@field ChargeClass string Indicates whether the row corrects a previously invoiced billing period. Always null for this endpoint, which does not return corrections.
---@field ChargeDescription string A human-readable summary of the charge.
---@field ChargePeriodEnd string Indicates the end of the charge period.
---@field ChargePeriodStart string Indicates the start of the charge period.
---@field ConsumedQuantity number Specifies the quantity consumed during this charge period.
---@field ConsumedUnit string A display name for the unit of measurement used for the product (for example, "GB-months", "GB-seconds"). May be empty when the unit is implicit in the service name.
---@field ContractedCost number Specifies the cost for this charge period in the billing currency.
---@field CumulatedContractedCost number Specifies the cumulated cost for the billing period in the billing currency.
---@field CumulatedPricingQuantity number Specifies the portion of usage that is actually subject to a unit price.
---@field EffectiveCost number The amortized cost of the charge. PayGo has no upfront commitments, so this equals ContractedCost.
---@field HostProviderName string The provider that hosts the infrastructure or platform the service runs on.
---@field InvoiceIssuerName string The entity that issues the invoice for this charge.
---@field ListCost number The cost at published list prices, before any discount. PayGo has no commitment discounts, so this equals ContractedCost.
---@field PricingQuantity number Specifies the pricing quantity for this charge period.
---@field PricingUnit string The unit that PricingQuantity is expressed in. Unlike ConsumedUnit this is never empty; it falls back to "Count" when the service has no explicit unit.
---@field ServiceName string Identifies the Cloudflare service.
---@field ServiceProviderName string The provider of the purchased service.
---@field ServiceFamilyName? string|distilled.Null Identifies the product family for the Cloudflare service.
---@field SubscriptionId? string|distilled.Null The identifier for the Cloudflare subscription.
---@field ZoneId? string|distilled.Null The identifier for the Cloudflare zone (zone tag).
---@field ZoneName? string|distilled.Null The display name of the Cloudflare zone.

---@alias cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV1ResultItemChargeCategory "Usage"

---@alias cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV1ResultList cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV1ResultItem[]

---@class cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV2Request
---@field account_id string Represents a Cloudflare resource identifier tag.
---@field from? string Start date for the usage query (ISO 8601). Required if `to` is set. When omitted along with `to`, defaults to the start of the current month. Filters by charge period (when consumption happened), not billing period. The maximum date range is 31 days.
---@field to? string End date for the usage query (ISO 8601). Required if `from` is set. When omitted along with `from`, defaults to today. Filters by charge period (when consumption happened), not billing period. The maximum date range is 31 days.

---@class cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV2ResultItem
---@field ChargeCategory cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV2ResultItemChargeCategory Highest-level classification of a charge based on the nature of how it gets billed. Currently only "Usage" is supported.
---@field ChargeDescription string Self-contained summary of the charge's purpose and price.
---@field ChargeFrequency cloudflare.billing.UsageGetAccountUsageV2ResultItemChargeFrequency Indicates how often a charge occurs. Currently only "Usage-Based" is supported.
---@field ChargePeriodEnd string Exclusive end of the time interval during which the usage was consumed.
---@field ChargePeriodStart string Inclusive start of the time interval during which the usage was consumed.
---@field ConsumedUnit string Unit of measure for the consumed quantity (e.g., "GB", "Requests", "vCPU-Hours").
---@field HostProviderName string Name of the entity providing the underlying infrastructure or platform.
---@field InvoiceIssuerName string Name of the entity responsible for invoicing for the services consumed.
---@field ServiceProviderName string Name of the entity that made the services available for purchase.
---@field x_BillableMetricId string The unique identifier for the billable metric in the Cloudflare catalog. Cloudflare extension; replaces FOCUS SkuId.
---@field BilledCost? number|distilled.Null A charge serving as the basis for invoicing, inclusive of all reduced rates and discounts while excluding the amortization of upfront charges (one-time or recurring).
---@field BillingAccountId? string|distilled.Null Public identifier of the Cloudflare account (account tag). Omitted when account is not part of the requested grouping, and always omitted for usage measured at contract level, even when grouping by account: that usage is returned as its own record with no account.
---@field BillingAccountName? string|distilled.Null Display name of the Cloudflare account. Omitted when account is not part of the requested grouping, and for usage measured at contract level.
---@field BillingCurrency? string|distilled.Null Currency that a charge was billed in (ISO 4217).
---@field BillingPeriodEnd? string|distilled.Null Exclusive end of the billing cycle that contains this usage record.
---@field BillingPeriodStart? string|distilled.Null Inclusive start of the billing cycle that contains this usage record.
